## Troubleshooting Checklist

| Problem | Solution |
|---------|----------|
| "Connection refused" | MySQL isn't running → Start MySQL service |
| "Access denied" | Wrong username/password → Check credentials |
| "Unknown database" | Database doesn't exist → Create it first |
| Can't find connection | Check Database Navigator panel (Window → Show View → Database Navigator) |
| Can't right-click | Make sure connection is selected/active |

